Inputs per track (Segno: docs/design/recording.md §3, §4).

tracktion sets monitoring per input device, and its MIDI channel setting rewrites the channel of
incoming messages. Segno chooses both per track, so a track's input destination may carry:
- "fdMonitor" ("on", "off" or "automatic"): its own monitoring, used instead of the device's;
- "fdChannel" (1-16): that track hears and records only that MIDI channel (the live MIDI node
  and the recording context for the target skip other channels).

